AB  - Internet of Things technology is widely used in all aspects of people's daily life and industrial production, which leads to a dramatic increase in the types and quantities of Internet of Things terminal devices. In addition, compared with traditional Internet software, the application scenarios of IoT cloud platform are more different. Due to the above two reasons, there are still many challenges in the architectural design of IoT gateway software and IoT cloud platform. Aiming at the above problems, this paper designs a set of IoT gateway software framework based on message pump for component coupling, which realizes multi-type device adaptation and component automation configuration based on reflection mechanism and configuration file mapping mechanism. Through the high-level abstraction of components, combined with pool technology, callback mechanism and thread monitoring mechanism, the software coupling degree is reduced, and the extended support of operating system level is provided. Comparison experiments with open-source gateway verify the effectiveness and superiority of this design. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
