AB  - The spectrum of artificial intelligence (AI) renaissance, advanced data privacy and security measures are becoming indispensable foundations for metaverse or cloud computing. Metaverse and AI encryption methods are used to protect sensitive data from cyber- attacks, using behavioral analytics inside and outside of its borders and autonomous malware detection. AI to cloud computing cannot be an exception as it strengthens data storage, access controls and real- time anomaly detection. Privacy is truly shifted to left by AI based prevention through always- on and continuous reinforcement privacy that find vulnerabilities equip with intelligent countermeasures predict risk ascent before any breach. Those machine learning models develop the security policy as alerts and other incidents happen and they do this on a continually updated basis in real- time. AI fosters the creation of privacy by design and data security architectures as an evolution that supports a safe, user-focused digital future for metaverse and cloud- computing. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
