AB  - To efficiently handle finances and enhance quality of life, optimizing financial planning is crucial. Challenges like inaccurate data and delayed processing hinder current financial planners. Advanced machine learning is vital for automating and optimizing financial planning, ensuring accurate advice on savings, goalsetting, investments, and tax efficiency. Human errors risk stability. 'FinGenius: An Automatic Financial Planner' tackles these issues with tailored recommendations for budgeting, retirement planning, and investments, including sustainable funds. It integrates predictive analytics, real-time data processing, multilingual support, and robust security measures. Utilizing machine learning models like CNN, RNN, and K-means clustering, it achieves superior performance in financial data analysis, benchmarked against historical S&P stock data. Integration with APIs and cloud platforms (AWS, GCP) enhances utility and accuracy (F1 score: 0.88). This research underscores the role of technology in improving user experience, ensuring data security, and optimizing financial management. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
