AB  - The proceedings contain 17 papers. The special focus in this conference is on Computer Applications in Industry and Engineering. The topics include: An Interactive Question Answer Based System on Alzheimer’s Disease Using Retrieval Augmented Generation; assessing the Impact of Prompt Strategies on Text Summarization with Large Language Models; Evaluation of the Effectiveness of Prompts and Generative AI Responses; Securing RC Based P2P Networks: A Blockchain-Based Access Control Framework Utilizing Ethereum Smart Contracts for IoT and Web 3.0; Integrating Blockchain-Based Security and Privacy with QML in Edge Computing for 6G Networks; an Analysis of Malicious Behaviors of Open-Source Packages Using Dynamic Analysis; accessible Cybersecurity Education Using Prompt Tree; bayesian Parameter Inference in Stochastic Biochemical Models Using Moment Approximations; introducing Multidimensional Parallel Decoder to Reduce Cost of Implementation and Latency; introducing Novel Parallel Computing Using Orbital Data; image Segmentation Network Based on Convolutional Layers, a Clustering Layer and Cluster Classification; Measuring API Usability and the Environment: A YouTube API Case Study; Enabling Seamless Healthcare Services with RC-Based Geographical Peer-to-Peer Fog Architecture in the Healthcare 4.0; applying Skyline Operator and Taxicab Geometry to Identify Optimal Locations for Establishing Business Properties; a New Pseudorandom Binary Generator Based on Nonlinear Feedback Registers with Boolean Function Combined Using Multiplexers. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
