AB  - This research paper presents the development of a Real Estate Marketplace using the MERN (MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, Node.js) stack. This research integrates advanced authentication mechanisms, including JWT, Firebase, and Google OAuth, ensuring secure and seamless user access. Real-world CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) operations are facilitated through MongoDB, allowing users to interact with property listings effectively. User experience is enhanced with intuitive features such as image uploads and property management tools. Advanced search functionality enables precise property discovery, contributing to increased user engagement. The paper also provides a detailed guide on deploying the MERN real estate application using the 'render' platform, emphasizing accessibility and scalability. This highlights the importance of utilizing modern technologies to create secure, user-friendly, and robust real estate platforms designed to meet evolving market demands. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
