AB  - The proceedings contain 30 papers. The topics discussed include: leveraging network methods for hub-like microservice detection; a case study on simplifying mobile integration using JAX-RS reference implementation for RESTful web services; choreography at the edge: a multivocal literature review; a case study on microservices-based integration of cloud-hosted Sphera MDM and Oracle ERP using Oracle SOA; comparing neural and statistical time-series models for proactive auto-scaling in Kubernetes; engineering critical analysis software services: a graph-RAG and self-learning large language model agent services approach; and formal methods for verifying authorization policy in microservice systems. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
