AB  - Cloud automation is a technology that provides the ability to rapidly deploy and manage applications in cloud environments. With the increasing popularity of cloud computing, organizations must be able to efficiently and securely deploy applications. The use of automation techniques in building the solution simplifies the entire Deployment and Onboarding at scale process, minimizing time & effort. Cloud technology provides auto-provisioning of resources; therefore, your apps scale automatically according to user demand. Furthermore, it also has enough high-level strong protection against potential threats such as cyber-attacks and data theft in prevention. Data encryption and access controls, along with regular security updates, ensure that sensitive data and applications are well-protected. This solution allows organizations to monitor the performance of their applications through these capabilities in real-time, thus making instant decisions to maintain service availability at all times. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
