TI  - A comprehensive security framework for cloud-based remote sensing image storage and retrieval with adversarial attack resistance
PY  - 2025
T2  - International Journal of Computers and Applications
VL  - 47
IS  - 9
SP  - 766
EP  - 790
DO  - 10.1080/1206212X.2025.2545912
