AD  - Vel Tech Rangarajan Dr.Sagunthala R&D Institute of Science and Technology, Chennai, India
AB  - This article introduces a robust, web-based platform designed for effective data management and visualization, tailored to meet the challenges posed by the exponential growth of data and increasing cybersecurity risks. The platform integrates cutting-edge security measures, including data encryption, access control based on roles, and advanced intrusion detection systems, to safeguard the confidentiality and integrity of information. By utilizing a distributed database architecture and blockchain technology for audit logging, the system not only improves storage efficiency but also ensures transparent and secure data transactions. A user-friendly visualization tool enables the creation of dynamic dashboards, empowering users to make informed decisions while maintaining the protection of sensitive data. The platform's implementation of a zero-trust security model significantly boosts processing efficiency and enhances the accuracy of threat detection, making it an ideal solution for enterprise, healthcare, and data centers. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
