AB  - The AI-Powered E-Learning Platform is a modern online learning environment created to use artificial intelligence to improve education. Each of the three main roles - Admin, Faculty, and User - has distinct functions. The administrator has complete authority over content modification, platform operations, and faculty and user account management. The system provides faculty with insightful teaching tools and guarantees an enhanced learning experience for students through AI-driven doubt clarification and intelligent video recommendations. The platform creates a flexible and engaging learning environment by automating content recommendations and facilitating real-time query resolution. AI in education holds the potential to close gaps, improve educational opportunities, and strengthen rural communities. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
