AB  - This paper focuses on the research and implement of obtaining monitoring indicators for Redis cluster in distributed systems. With the rapid development of distributed systems, Redis cluster has become an essential component for handling large-scale data and high-concurrent access. By effectively monitoring Redis cluster, we can ensure its stable operation, optimize performance, and quickly detect and solve potential problems. This paper first analyzes the architecture and working principle of Redis cluster, then elaborates on the key monitoring indicators and their significance. Next, it presents a comprehensive acquisition scheme, including data collection, transmission, and storage methods based on the prometheus. Finally, through experimental verification, the effectiveness and feasibility of the proposed scheme are demonstrated. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
