AB  - With the increased reliance of enterprises on cloud storage solutions for data management, maintaining safe and efficient storage while emphasizing privacy protection is crucial. With an emphasis on user privacy, this study examines the methods, tools, and difficulties currently involved in attaining safe and effective cloud storage. It looks at access control protocols, encryption techniques like SHA-256, and new technologies that are intended to improve the security and effectiveness of cloud storage systems. The study also addresses the changing trends influencing the security of cloud storage in the future and emphasizes the significance of adhering to privacy laws. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
