AB  - This electronic Digital information, computer systems, networks, and data are highly in need of protection from damage, unauthorized access, and internal and external threats. Cyber security involves the implementation of strong procedures to protect digital resources by ensuring confidentiality, integrity, and availability. In the dynamic landscape of cyberspace, Cyber security is the umbrella term for tactics, tools, and procedures used to fend off a wide variety of threats, such as ransomware, phishing, malware, and other unwanted activity. This field continually evolves to counter emerging risks and vulnerabilities, requiring a proactive approach to identify, assess, and moderate potential security breaches. Cyber security is fundamental in preserving trust and reliability in digital interactions, serving as a critical component in our interconnected and technology-driven world. Here we focused on the large amount of data set to identify the level of confidentiality required and categories them using machine learning approaches. The results will be carryied forward for the high computational encryption and decryption to provide high security and provide access as per the need of the users. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
