AB  - This project focuses on developing a secure, AI-powered chatbot for retail chains, integrated within a web application to efficiently handle Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs). Utilizing IBM Watson’s advanced Natural Language Processing (NLP), the chatbot delivers precise, context-aware responses, enhancing the customer experience across retail environments. The platform offers a user-friendly interface for seamless interactions, a robust backend powered by IBM Watson’s AI model, and a database optimized for managing customer queries. A dedicated security module ensures data protection through encryption, authentication, and access control. This chatbot manages high volumes of inquiries with real-time responses, boosting customer engagement and operational efficiency while generating valuable insights for retail decision-making. Designed to be scalable and secure, the system upholds high standards of accessibility and data integrity, meeting the specific demands of the retail sector. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
