AB  - In the modern educational and professional landscape, the potential of alumni networks remains largely untapped, despite alumni being uniquely positioned to guide students in transitioning from academia to industry. This research project proposes a robust, AI-driven alumni networking platform tailored for colleges, enabling meaningful interactions between current students, alumni, and college administrators. The platform integrates tools for professional networking, real-time communication, job recommendations, and career guidance, addressing the need for structured alumni-student connections. Extensive testing, including user surveys and feedback, highlights the platform's effectiveness in enhancing alumni engagement and student preparedness for post-college life. The proposed system details the development, functionality, and impact of the platform, underscoring its role in building a collaborative community that benefits all stakeholders. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
