TI  - MedAccess HBPF: A Privacy-Preserving Hybrid-Blockchain Framework for Secure and Efficient Cloud-Based Electronic Health Record Sharing
PY  - 2024
T2  - SN Computer Science
VL  - 5
IS  - 8
C7  - 1018
DO  - 10.1007/s42979-024-03343-w
