AD  - IKON Tech Services LLC, Phoenix, United States
AB  - Network security is a crucial aspect of web development technology as it helps to protect web applications from cyberattacks, unauthorized access, and data breaches. With the increasing use of the internet and web-based applications, the need for secure networks has become more significant than ever before. Network security in web development technology involves a combination of technologies and practices that are implemented to protect the network infrastructure, web applications, and the data transmitted through them. This chapter covers the importance of network security in web development technology, the various threats faced by web applications, and the different measures taken to protect the network infrastructure. The paper will also explore the key technologies and best practices used in network security, including firewalls, intrusion detection and prevention systems, encryption, and access control. Additionally, the book chapter will examine the role of security testing in web development and how it helps to identify vulnerabilities in web applications before they can be exploited by attackers. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
