AB  - As businesses increasingly depend on these cloud-based services, secure cloud computing is vital. There is no free way with the cloud network, and our information is susceptible to vulnerability. Mitigation strategies to address these network vulnerabilities in cloud computing and analysis of the man-in-the-middle attack and Distributed Denial of Service (DDoS) attack are discussed in this paper. For instance: enhance network architecture, encryption, and security mechanisms like intrusion detection systems and firewalls. With these steps, organizations can further increase their cloud network security and protect data with zero breaches. © 2024 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
