AB  - Cloud Computing adoption has increased dramatically over the past few years, making the protection of sensitive data on the cloud a major concern. In this paper network security is presented as an effective way to ensure the security of data on the cloud using methods like encryption, access control, and DLP. The method concentrates on the security of the network infrastructure, and also the internal cloud environment security controls. This methodology combines internal and external security measures to provide an overall protection of data housed in the cloud. Conclusions The work is mainly intended to increase the understanding of the need for network security and shielding data in the cloud, and someways to enhance data security in the cloud for businesses and organizations. © 2024 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
