AD  - Nanjing University of Post and TeleCommunications, College of Automation and College of Artificial Intelligence, Nanjing, China
AB  - In order to overcome the inherent problems of practicality, security, and operability in traditional classrooms, we introduced an smart classroom cloud platform management system. This system integrates the smart classroom multifunctional management system, face recognition access control system, and user management cloud platform system. employing Raspberry Pi and STM32 microcontrollers as the main control units, the system gathers face information and environmental data through cameras and various sensors. The intelligent classroom management system is established using components like the LD3320 speech module, sensors, and relays to accomplish functions such as environment detection, speech control, and lighting control. Simultaneously, an intelligent real-time management cloud platform, built on the Springboot framework, facilitates functions like visitor management, entry and exit recording, and access control management. Test results affirm the system's capabilities in realizing speech control, access control management, and real-time remote control within the classroom. The intelligent system shows stable performance, user-friendly operation, seamless integration, and high accuracy in face and speech recognition. © 2024 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
