AB  - This paper not only provides a comprehensive analysis of security and privacy risks based on upcoming 6G technologies at the physical, connection, and service levels, but it also provides insights acquired from the weaknesses of cutting-edge defenses and security designs. However, at this time, 6G privacy and security concerns are largely theoretical. The paper investigates privacy and security challenges in 5G and 6G wireless technologies and introduces a novel quantum safe access control handshake method for cloud and edge computing. We introduced a unique access control handshake process with NS sequence and RLP protocol, which provides enough complexity to consider as an NP-hard problem. © 2024 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
