AB  - This research study addresses the importance of maintaining personal privacy in various cloud computing usage scenarios, considering the specific benefits and risks associated with each environment. It presents a robust solution for secure data transfer using cloud technology, focusing on protecting sensitive information during transit. The solution integrates advanced encryption protocols and secure communication channels to ensure end-to-end protection. Additionally, access controls and authentication mechanisms are employed to authorize legitimate recipients. The cloud infrastructure offers scalability and efficiency for seamless data exchange across diverse environments. Rigorous testing validates the system's resilience against potential vulnerabilities, providing a reliable and confidential data transfer process. Overall, this research study meets the critical need for safeguarding information integrity in today's dynamic digital landscape, offering a practical and effective solution. © 2024 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
