AB  - In the cloud environment, private data is stored on third-party servers, there is no way to prevent third-party servers from snooping on the data. Selective Encryption technique combining access control relationship and data encryption is proposed for cloud environment. We proposes a selective encryption optimization technology based on users' different access requirements for different data. By reducing the number of resource nodes, the efficiency of selecting encryption is improved. At the same time, a method to evaluate the cost based on the strategy graph of user access frequency is given to guide the selection of different strategy graphs according to user needs to realize the selection of encryption technology. Thus, users can quickly evolve the keys of frequently accessed data according to their keys, thus reducing the key evolution time. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
