AB  - The proceedings contain 15 papers. The topics discussed include: delegations in the solid dataspace: a proxy for rights delegation; discoverable and interoperable augmented reality environments through solid pods; towards distributed intelligent tutoring systems based on user-owned progress and performance data; a methodological approach to incremental view maintenance for optimizing SPARQL queries in solid; German data-sovereign government-to-citizen use case; cornerstones of a future solid B2B ecosystem: authorization app and rights delegation proxy; using Notation3 reasoning for crawling linked data in solid storages; empowering digital humanism in smart built environments through SOLID data spaces; operationalizing the law operationalizing the law through the solid environment: opportunities and challenges; and legal, technical, and social limitations of data portability through decentralized applications. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
