AB  - In this paper, we offer an upgraded security system to secure cloud users' information interior the cloud environment. This modern security system comprises of computerized marks, mystery get to control, and mystery strategies. Here, a unused strategy for creating exceedingly secure keys utilizing scrambled elliptic bends is proposed. This paper moreover proposes a special identity-based elliptic bend authorization instrument to confine cloud users' get to to distinctive sorts of information. A special two-phase unscrambling and encryption approach based on double values and circular bend biometric key values is depicted in arrange to superior safeguard cloud users' information within the cloud and its encompasses. This proposed security design moreover incorporates a progressive low-cost advanced signature method based on modulo capacities to guarantee information mystery. This security design gives tall information security, accessibility, and astuteness for client information. The test discoveries appear that, in terms of both steadfastness and security, the prescribed calculations within the previously mentioned security system are more successful than elective strategies that are as of now in utilize. Cloud computing has changed communication and information capacity by giving unmatched versatility and openness. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
