AB  - E-Secure is an advanced IoT-based home security system designed to enhance safety in both metropolitan and suburban environments. The system integrates a Raspberry Pi with various sensors to provide comprehensive security features, including facial recognition for guest authorization, real-time environmental monitoring, and remote access control. The system maintains a database of registered guest information, allowing users to remotely manage entry via a web interface. In the event of unauthorized access attempts, the system triggers immediate alerts and alarms, ensuring prompt user intervention. Additional safety measures include gas and motion detection, with real-time alerts sent to users and emergency services when necessary. By combining cutting-edge IoT technology with robust hardware components, E-Secure offers a versatile and reliable solution for modern home security, providing peace of mind through enhanced protection and convenience © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
