AB  - In the digital era, escalating data volumes necessitate secure and scalable file-sharing solutions. This research develops a private cloud architecture to address this need. It provides scalability through distributed servers, accommodating numerous users and data needs. Robust access controls, including authentication and encryption, ensure data security. The architecture supports diverse network configurations, enabling seamless file sharing. Synchronization and versioning facilitate collaboration, ensuring data integrity. In summary, our private cloud architecture offers secure, scalable, and efficient file sharing for organizations across various network scenarios. © 2024 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
