AB  - The article describes the development of a functional model and the application of an enterprise email system security subsystem. This addresses the problem of email delivery and ensures the prevention of email loss. The article presents the results of a case study on a company's infrastructure, identifying gaps in the existing system. It discusses the selection of an infrastructure and cloud provider, considering the benefits of containerization and cloud computing. The process of selecting a mail authorization server tailored to the organization's unique email requirements is explored. The article's conclusion underlines the usefulness and significance of the developed method for guarding against email loss in businesses that rely largely on email to effectively communicate with clients and partners. © 2023 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
