AB  - In this paper, we will discuss the challenges of Financial-grade API, focusing on prevention mechanisms for "Cuckoo's Token Attack"and delve into the current security authentication mechanisms of OAuth 2.0, Financial-grade API 2.0 and OpenID Connect. Finally, we found that the OpenID Connect method can mitigate the attack by using a one-time token and issuer identifier, but a one-time authentication method without the OpenID Connect requirement is also needed. © 2023 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
