AB  - The proceedings contain 33 papers. The topics discussed include: intelligent data center safety status prediction based on algorithm ensemble; research on solution of group data flow integration based on big data; soft actor-critic-based grid dispatching with distributed training; attribute-based searchable encryption with policy hidden in edge computing; energy-saving combined frequency conversion and ai for cloud and edge enabled data centers; predictive control based on transformer as surrogate model for cooling system optimization in data center; comparison of stability and energy consumption of AGV system based on clouding server and physical servers methods; joint physical-layer attributes-based authentication and authorization mechanism for green cloud data centers; exploiting implicit neural representation for temperature distribution reconstruction in data centers; and system for data center environmental monitoring that uses visible light communication positioning. © 2023 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
