TI  - A Small Leak Will Sink Many Ships: Vulnerabilities Related to mini-programs Permissions
PY  - 2023
T2  - Proceedings - IEEE Computer Society's International Computer Software and Applications Conference
VL  - 2023-June
SP  - 595
EP  - 606
DO  - 10.1109/COMPSAC57700.2023.00085
