AB  - The financial system is the soul of the company. A stable and well-functioning financial system is of great significance to the handling of financial affairs, the accounting and payment of employees' salaries, the management of company assets and even the smooth operation of the company. Based on the saa S model, this paper understands the existing problems and shortcomings in the field of enterprise management accounting information based on investigation and literature reading, introduces cloud computing, a new Internet technology, into the implementation of enterprise management accounting informatization, and puts forward the research topic of management accounting informatization in small and medium-sized enterprises. The system is developed in the SaaS mode, and data management is carried out by sharing data. At the same time, the role-based access control method is used to ensure the security of data. Practice shows that the application of information technology to enterprise financial module realizes the integration of resources within the financial system and even enterprises. © 2023 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
