is article, we have mitigated the process of blockchain that implements and connects to cloud computing technology. We are concerned about the blockchain framework in this post, which integrates and interfaces to cloud computing technology. We are discussing the two emerging technologies work together and give us better implementation results. © 2023 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
