AB  - The proceedings contain 37 papers. The topics discussed include: urban traffic forecasting using federated and continual learning; dimensionality-reducing classifiers for Spanish winter maintenance of roadways; estimation of the cycling cadence using low-cost inertial sensors mounted on a bicycle; introduction of a cloud computing architecture for the condition monitoring of a reconfigurable battery system for electric vehicles; an adaptive exponential min sum decoding algorithm; zero-knowledge and identity-based authentication, authorization, access control, and key exchange for publish/subscribe in Internet of things; log message with JSON item count for root cause analysis in microservices; vulnerability and threat assessment framework for Internet of things systems; sensitivity analysis of LSTM networks for fall detection wearable sensors; and Skystrm: an activity monitoring system to support elderly independence through smart care homes. © 2023 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
