TI  - A Parallel Secure Flow Control Framework for Private Data Sharing in Mobile Edge Cloud
PY  - 2022
T2  - IEEE Transactions on Parallel and Distributed Systems
VL  - 33
IS  - 12
SP  - 4638
EP  - 4653
DO  - 10.1109/TPDS.2022.3200959
