TI  - Using Attribute-Based Access Control, Efficient Data Access in the Cloud with Authorized Search
PY  - 2022
T2  - International Journal of Electrical and Computer Engineering Systems
VL  - 13
IS  - 7
SP  - 569
EP  - 575
