AB  - In today's globalized world, digitalization continues to increase. We could only do limited tasks on a computer system in the early days. Now AI, ML, deep learning, and some other technologies have enabled us to perform several types of tasks on a computer system. There may be problems with communication with digital devices in today's world where technology is advancing day by day. Digitalization isn't beneficial if people can't operate these devices. For this reason, we developed a device in the form of a wristwatch and robot integration with AI, ML, and Cloud. Machine learning, Artificial intelligence, and cloud services allow the user to execute almost every type of order or command without any usage of a keyboard just by saying or by the action of the hand. This device has different features for people of different generations. Older virtual working devices lack security features, voice authentication, and authorization. This device reduces the use of several devices, such as mobile phones, input devices like keyboards, mouse, etc. mainly for an older generation. It provides assistance, authentication of voice, and security to a large extent as it is wearable so it is easy to carry and handle. © 2022 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
