AB  - Robot education has always been an interesting research topic recently. With the development of the Internet of Things and 5G, many companies have developed smart security robots. Therefore, the research on robot education cannot be delayed. In this research, the factory warehouse is the experimental field, and the intelligent system is used as a platform for research integration in the research. Many sensors are installed such as temperature sensors and smoke sensors in the space of the factory warehouse with the use of programming to integrate and monitor the factory warehouse. When a fire occurs, the smoke sensor detects heavy smoke and sends an alarm message to the owner and guard on duty. At the same time, an access control system and a monitoring system are installed to identify personnel entering and exiting, and use the cloud platform to integrate. When using the access card to enter and exit, the surveillance system located above the door takes pictures of people. In the research, the entire warehouse space is treated as an intelligent robot for simulation, and the integrated system achieves the functions of disaster prevention, theft prevention, and the entry and exit of personnel. © 2022 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
