AB  - The proceedings contain 20 papers. The special focus in this conference is on Wireless Communications and Applications. The topics include: Information Extraction for Knowledge Graph of ISO 19650 Standards; network Security Risk Analysis of Ship Intelligent Navigation; contactless Access Control System Based on Voiceprint Recognition; pingan Campus Intelligent Security Monitoring System Design; an Intelligent Patrol System Based on Edge Data Center Station; research on Construction Scheme of Coastal Water Transportation and Communication Network Based on 5G Technology; A CNN-Based Information Network Attack Detection Algorithm; comprehensive Evaluation of Intelligent Obstacle Avoidance Function by Changing Lanes of Vehicle Based on an Improved Evaluation Index System; an Evaluation Method of Wireless Communication Key Performance Through Receiving the Signal Transmitting by Itself; a Method for Optimizing Communication Network Topology Based on Genetic Algorithm; a Security Reinforcement Model for Edge Computing Facilities in 5G Power Network; research on Multi-dimensional Sensitivity Economic Evaluation Method of Digital Technology in Power Grid Enterprises; heterogeneous Data Fusion Method for Abnormal Network Traffic; preface; equipment Terminals Optimization Control Method for Sensing Terminal of Power IoT Platform; establishment of Vulnerability Sample Database in Network Attack Environment; an Essential Vigilance Analysis on Security of Web Applications; A Retrospective Sustainable Glimpse to Improve Project Management via ICT. © 2022 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
