AB  - The proceedings contain 36 papers. The topics discussed include: investigating the robustness of IoT security cameras against cyber-attacks; towards a cloud-native 5G service chaining for IoT and video analytics in smart campus; remote healthcare monitoring using wearable IoT devices and cloud services; multipath-routing based load-balancing in SDN networks; energy and delay aware computation offloading scheme in mcc environment; an efficient strategy with high availability for dynamic provisioning of access points in large-scale wireless networks; MT-AODV: resilient communication in military mobile ad-hoc networks through on-demand multiple routing tables; MS2M: a message-based approach for live stateful microservices migration; and an access control and authentication scheme for secure data sharing in the decentralized cloud storage system. © 2022 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
