AB  - In this study, the mixed training mode of business English cloud classroom based on mobile APP with shared SDK is discussed. The mobile network system has the numerous APIs that allow developers to easily use the system resources, but the mobile platform also has a corresponding authorization system to restrict the behavior of application software. To avoid the fact that the traditional cloud platform suffer from the risks of data security and the transmission efficiency, this paper adopts the SDK optimization as the basis to create the efficient model. Furthermore, the novel mixed training unit has been integrated to the designed framework and the business English cloud classroom scenario is considered to validate the performance of the designed model. From the results, it is proven that the performance is high better than the previous ones. © 2022 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
