AB  - In this paper, a complete monitoring platform based on distributed application system is designed for cloud computing environment, which is used to capture the resource utilization and load capacity of distributed application nodes. With the help of manual configuration strategy, cloud computing resources can be dynamically scheduled and the elastic computing ability of cloud computing environment can be fully utilized by application. It focuses on the creation of access credentials, storage services, MSSQL and Azure database services, cloud services and the access control of cloud platform. Finally, taking an actual building project as an example, the monitoring principle and function of the latest BAS after supplement and modification are implemented in the weak construction drawing to verify the effectiveness of the improved work. © 2021 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
