AB  - The proceedings contain 39 papers. The topics discussed include: fog computing and the Internet of Things (IoT): a review; security and privacy challenges in 5G-enabled technology; blockchain-based access control approaches; a survey on cloudlets, mobile edge, and fog computing; secure neural network in federated learning with model aggregation under multiple keys; research on load-balancing index algorithm for smart grid system; machine learning based network censorship; ceramic anti-counterfeiting technology identification method based on blockchain; network intrusion detection based on subspace clustering and BP neural network; optimizing the allocation of secure fog resources based on QoS requirements; and attention based multi-unit spatial-temporal network for traffic flow forecasting. © 2021 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
