TI  - Effect of intensifier additives on the performance of butanolic extract of date palm leaves against the corrosion of api 5l x60 carbon steel in 15 wt.% hcl solution
PY  - 2021
T2  - Sustainability (Switzerland)
VL  - 13
IS  - 10
