AB  - Physical education these days no longer applies to today's younger generations (Gen Y). Internet reading and reading grades that are popularly known as online education play a vital role in the country's education system. There is no denying that online education offers many benefits to younger students. In our proposed idea is to build a website that will use HTML, CSS and JS frontend and Php and MySQL backend. It contains a registration page where you will request user verification. In this case the user can create on his / her id containing username and password. On the home page four tap menu in the navigation bar namely home, services, by us, Contact Us. In each menu will have features, for example, a contact button that will allow the user to contact us with feedback. Our proposed system introduces an interactive method for the user to read blogs delivered by various technologies or teachers related to those subjects and will allow the user to ask his or her questions. In this way it will provide a smart and automated web education app for the academic advisory program. The application is used to promote learning and promote student development by automatically identifying and achieving their educational need and goals. © 2021 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
