AB  - The proceedings contain 226 papers. The topics discussed include: transfer learning approach for diabetic retinopathy detection using residual network; efficient fault isolation method to monitor industrial batch processes; case study on well-known topic modeling methods for document classification; self-healing fault tolerance technique in cloud datacenter; modelling and analysis of magnetically coupled impedance source inverter for solar photovoltaic systems; a meta-heuristic-based green-routing algorithm in software-defined wireless sensor network; a flexible access control with user revocation in fog-enabled cloud computing; a vision based face tracking using camshift with BLBP algorithm in head gesture recognition system; a novel deep learning and machine learning powered approach for image forgery detection; and multi-user authentication using biometric sensor using parallel processing algorithm for attendance monitoring. © 2021 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
