AB  - Relevant surveys indicate that the existing websites of digital cultural centers generally have three problems: insufficient user interaction, small number of users, and low user stickiness. Based on the three problems, this paper proposes the concept of open creation of virtual resources for digital cultural centers; divides the open creation function modules into three systems: an open system for literary and artistic creation/performance/collection, an open system for digital cultural resources creation, and a micro-copyright authorization and tracking system; and designs the open production process for each system module. © 2022 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
