TI  - Analysing Security Concerns About the Massive Increase of Sharing Data over the Cloud During the Pandemic of Covid-19
PY  - 2021
T2  - Communications in Computer and Information Science
VL  - 1487 CCIS
SP  - 469
EP  - 480
DO  - 10.1007/978-981-16-8059-5_29
