AB  - The proceedings contain 71 papers. The special focus in this conference is on Inventive Systems and Control. The topics include: A Comprehensive Study of Machine Translation Tools and Evaluation Metrics; a Novel Approach for Finding Invasive Ductal Carcinoma Using Machine Learning; cluster Performance by Dynamic Load and Resource-Aware Speculative Execution; matyas–Meyer–Oseas Skein Cryptographic Hash Blockchain-Based Secure Access Control for E-Learning in Cloud; chapman Kolmogorov and Jensen Shannon Ant Colony Optimization-Based Resource Efficient Task Scheduling in Cloud; security Aspects in Cloud Tools and Its Analysis—A Study; Industrial Internet of Things (IIoT): A Vivid Perspective; Exposure Effect of 900 MHz Electromagnetic Field Radiation on Antioxidant Potential of Medicinal Plant Withania Somnifera; smart City: Recent Advances and Research Issues; content Based Scientific Article Recommendation System Using Deep Learning Technique; design Considerations for Low Noise Amplifier; HOUSEN: Hybrid Over–Undersampling and Ensemble Approach for Imbalance Classification; e-Pro: Euler Angle and Probabilistic Model for Face Detection and Recognition; foreword; preface; knowledge Graphs in Recommender Systems; classification of Covid-19 Tweets Using Deep Learning Techniques; applied Classification Algorithms Used in Data Mining During the Vocational Guidance Process in Machine Learning; meta-Heuristic Algorithm for the Global Optimization: Intelligent Ice Fishing Algorithm; Progression of EEG-BCI Classification Techniques: A Study; cuckoo Scheduling Algorithm for Lifetime Optimization in Sensor Networks of IoT; Design and Development of an Automated Snack Maker with CNN-Based Quality Monitoring; an Effective Deep Learning-Based Variational Autoencoder for Zero-Day Attack Detection Model; image-Text Matching: Methods and Challenges; fault Location in Transmission Line Through Deep Learning—A Systematic Review. © 2021 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
