AB  - With the development of dispatching and control cloud platform, the existing virtual resource management mechanism has been unable to meet the requirements of rapid construction, agile delivery and convenient management of applications. The emergence of Docker technology provides a good solution. Combined with the Docker technology and the requirements of image repository management. In this paper, we introduce an Image Repository Management System of dispatching and control cloud based on Docker technology, introduces the overall architecture of the platform, Including secure application image hosting capabilities, image distribution scheme, stable image building services and convenient image authorization functions to facilitate users to manage the entire life cycle of images. © 2021 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
