AB  - Cloud computing is an innovative technology to support outsourcing of computing resources on-demand. But it is lack of security, confidentiality, and privacy. This paper attempts to propose a solution to the above-said problems by a secure, confidential and Fully Homomorphic Encryption technique with the desired level of access control. The present scheme is based on symmetric keys and Smith Normal Form assures the homomorphic property. All the operations are simple matrix multiplications and consequently, the present scheme sustains the owners of the cloud to secure their private data from its uncertain clients. © 2021 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
