AB  - This paper proposes a cloud platform that provides support for all stages of the development of intelligent building management systems, their adaptation for solving applied problems for applications of the Internet of Things and management in building automation systems, storing knowledge and data bases in cloud data centers, providing access to intelligent systems as services remotely via the web interface. The model and structure of an intelligent multi-service platform for building management is presented, which includes the following components: monitoring and management of engineering subsystems; access control; accounting and control of working hours; renting; resident/tenant portal; video content analysis based on neural networks and deep learning; resource analytics. The functions of the platform components are considered in detail, screens of the system operation in one of the business centers are shown. © 2021 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
