AB  - The proceedings contain 25 papers. The topics discussed include: the semantic spreadsheet; the burn-to-claim cross-blockchain asset transfer protocol; visual counterexample explanation for model checking with OERITTE; formal synthesis of trajectories for unmanned aerial vehicles to perform resilient surveillance of critical power transmission lines; automatic verification of multi-threaded programs by inference of rely-guarantee specifications; ReoFS: a read-efficient and write-optimized file system for persistent memory; optimizing communication strategies in contested and dynamic environments; formal verification of access control model for my health record system; achieving weight coverage for an autonomous driving system with search-based test generation; and foggy: a new anonymous communication architecture based on microservices. © 2023 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
