TI  - BPS: A reliable and efficient pub/sub communication model with blockchain-enhanced paradigm in multi-tenant edge cloud
PY  - 2020
T2  - Journal of Parallel and Distributed Computing
VL  - 143
SP  - 167
EP  - 178
DO  - 10.1016/j.jpdc.2020.05.005
