AB  - The proceedings contain 78 papers. The topics discussed include: eathentication: a chewing-based authentication method; website cryptojacking detection using machine learning; hybrid analysis of android apps for security vetting using deep learning; secure end-to-end sensing in supply chains; perturbing inputs to prevent model stealing; off is not off: on the security of parked vehicles; query-crafting DoS threats against Internet DNS; cloud-based face and speech recognition for access control applications; SYMBION: interleaving symbolic with concrete execution; towards a believable decoy system: replaying network activities from real system; and cyber security decision making informed by cyber threat intelligence (CYDETI). © 2020 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
