AB  - The proceedings contain 69 papers. The topics discussed include: a learning automata-based algorithm for energy-efficient elastic optical networks; pattern detection based network diagnostics; adapting spectrum resources using predicted IP traffic in optical networks; impact of human and content factors on quality of experience of online video streaming; amalgamation of fog computing and software defined networking in Healthcare 4.0: the challenges, and a way forward; business to system requirements agile mapping; fair exchange e-commerce protocol for multi-chained complex transactions; the economic impact of intellectual property management: towards model of intellectual property management; helper-in-the-middle: supporting web application scanners targeting industrial control systems; termination of Ethereum’s smart contracts; and avoiding network and host detection using packet bit-masking. © 2024 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
