AB  - Web system for detecting malfunctions in combinational logic circuits using OIDC authentication is designed. This paper discusses some problems which can occur in combinational logic circuits, user authentication, and how we can cope with them. Online system using OIDC for solving such problems using the method “truth table” is described. Creating and using multiple login accounts for different educational systems can be problematic and hard to track for students. The web application for educational purposes will track student’s performance and will help teachers in evaluating their work and efforts. © 2020 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
