AB  - Internet has become one of the most important aspects in day-to-day life. Due to enormous amount of information available on the internet maintaining Confidentiality and Privacy of data transmitted across the network is still an issue. Many people are unaware of the right place to share their details. Lack of knowledge leads to hacking and misuse of personal and confidential information by many intruders. To reduce this, a novel approach has been introduced, which analyses on all the sites in the network and approves only valid sites. Machine learning algorithms are used in the system to analyze the sites and help the users know about the integrity of the site. E-commerce being one of the major parts of the internet, providing payment information in the payment gateway also is a challenging task. To provide authorization for the e-commerce transactions , this system is developed which assures the integrity of site along with identification of fraudulence in payment gateway. © 2020 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
