AB  - The proceedings contain 35 papers. The special focus in this conference is on Recent Advancement in Computer, Communication and Computational Sciences. The topics include: Applicability of Financial System Using Deep Learning Techniques; Novel Reversible ALU Architecture Using DSG Gate; an Appraisal on Microstrip Array Antenna for Various Wireless Communications and Their Applications; workload Aware Dynamic Scheduling Algorithm for Multi-core Systems; almost Self-centered Index of Some Graphs; computationally Efficient Scheme for Simulation of Ring Oscillator Model; comparative Analysis of Consensus Algorithms of Blockchain Technology; a Roadmap to Realization Approaches in Natural Language Generation; a Case Study of Structural Health Monitoring by Using Wireless Sensor Networks; comparative Analysis of Graph Clustering Algorithms for Detecting Communities in Social Networks; TBSAC: Token-Based Secured Access Control for Cloud Data; 2DBSCAN with Local Outlier Detection; classification of Documents based on Local Binary Pattern Features through Age Analysis; An Efficient Task Scheduling Strategy for DAG in Cloud Computing Environment; web-Based Movie Recommender System; a Two-Step Dimensionality Reduction Scheme for Dark Web Text Classification; TLC Algorithm in IoT Network for Visually Challenged Persons; Educational App for Android-Specific Users—EA-ASU; Personality Prediction System Through CV Analysis; image Enhancement: A Review; Energy-Efficient Heterogeneous WCEP for Enhancing Coverage Lifetime in WSNs; diagnosis of Cough and Cancer Using Image Compression and Decompression Techniques; 3D Lung Segmentation Using Thresholding and Active Contour Method; DWT-LBP Descriptors for Chest X-Ray View Classification; comparative Study of Latent Fingerprint Image Segmentation Techniques Based on Literature Review; Hybrid Domain Feature-Based Image Super-resolution Using Fusion of APVT and DWT. © 2020 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
