AB  - A payment gateway is a service that authorizes and processes debit/credit card or other payments for online merchants it facilitates these transactions by encrypting sensitive data and transferring it between a payment portal (a website or a mobile device) and the bank/front end processor. In this paper we examine the transaction process, even though it takes only a few seconds, several steps are accomplished during that brief window of time. Here we present a generalized net model with intuitionistic fuzzy estimations of such an internet payment gateway. © 2020 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
