AB  - The proceedings contain 22 papers. The topics discussed include: budgeted algorithm for linearized confidence-weighted learning; interpolation-based k-means clustering improvement for sparse, high dimensional data; people-centered computing within limits: system thinking on interventions of internet platforms; an approach of multi-attribute group decision making; cloud platform real-time test method based on network packet delay comparison; authorization model definition for an adaptable workflow within cloud environment; data and information flows. assessing threads and opportunities to ensure privacy and investment returns; big data platforms and tools for data analytics in the data science engineering curriculum; and an order dispatch approach in large-scale telemarketing system. © 2022 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
