AD  - South China University of Technology, School of Computer Science & Engineering, Guangzhou, China
AB  - —Access control model is a very important component for Internet of Things, which is located at front end of the platform. It is responsible for the communication between cloud platform and physical devices, and preprocessing device data through protocol. The overall performance of cloud platform depends largely on the performance of access control model. A high-performance (includes: high concurrency, high availability and high scalability) access control model for urban street lamp IoT is designed and implemented in this paper. And the experiment results verify the access control model that mentioned in this paper, which it has good performance and the ability to access tens of thousands of street lighting devices. © 2020 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
