AB  - When we need to share private corporate data over the servers of cloud, it becomes mandatory to acquire an expert encryption method using a pompous access control for encrypting the outsourced data. Our master design motive must be to serve the owner of data to gain snobby access control over the files accumulated by Cloud Computing Servers. Indicatively, we would like to authorize the owner of data for implementing an absolute access mechanism upon every user, which unambiguously nominates the group of files which the user is legitimate to acquire. It is also needed that Cloud Servers should be prevented to get known of the data file information along with the advantage of accessing user data. In inclusion, the suggested plan must be efficient to attain security aims such as user responsibility and supports general actions like individual permission/cancellation like common one-to-many transmission system that is needed. These of the designing aims must be gained perfectly in such a way that the system is expandable. © 2019 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
