TI  - RCAC: A secure and privacy preserving RFID based cloud-assisted access control to IoT integrated smart home
PY  - 2019
T2  - International Journal of Innovative Technology and Exploring Engineering
VL  - 8
IS  - 4
SP  - 693
EP  - 700
