AB  - In this paper, based on the hardware physical characteristics of Internet of Things(IoT) devices and its operating system, we designed a driver interface specification and an example based on the application terminal under the Internet and realizes the plug and play, registration, acquisition and release of the device. The Internet of Things (IoT) cloud platform is constructed to enable IoT devices to access the cloud platform. Users, developers and vendors can manage devices and drivers on the platform, complete the functions of device addition, driver addition, logical free networking and flexible configuration of user-oriented cloud-based IoT devices, making the platform a loosely coupled cloud computing platform. © 2019 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
