TI  - Janus: A Generic QoS Framework for Software-as-a-Service Applications
PY  - 2018
T2  - Proceedings - IEEE International Conference on Cluster Computing, ICCC
VL  - 2018-September
C7  - 8514859
SP  - 55
EP  - 65
