AB  - Based on the characteristics of the hierarchical architecture of cloud computing, this paper discusses the confidentiality, integrity and usability of multi-dimensional security system based on user dimension, dimension, business dimension and basic dimension. According to this division, this paper puts forward specific security technologies and strategies, through the use and management of the "cloud" of the main (cloud computing users and service providers) and "cloud" implementation environment (network hardware environment and Social system environment) into the cloud security off the system, as much as possible to grasp the cloud computing in the application and promotion process in all aspects of the problem, thus establishing a comprehensive, comprehensive "trusted cloud" system. In the discussion of multi-dimensional system model, each dimension of security protection has its own emphasis. Based on the trust management technology, the user authentication and authorization system based on trust management are put forward. Data dimension and data encryption technology research, design and implementation of a cloud storage security solutions. Service-oriented to security audit and monitoring as the focus, put forward service-oriented cloud security monitoring system. The basic dimension focuses on network and application system host security. In addition, a standardization evaluation system for cloud security is put forward to improve the multi-dimensional protection system for safety standardization. © 2019 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
