AB  - The proceedings contain 84 papers. The topics discussed include: little-big deep neural networks for embedded video surveillance; on a game theoretic approach to detect the low-rate denial of service attacks; performance evaluation of a tracking algorithm for Galileo E1 signals; smart city as a 5G ready application; a flexible authorization mechanism for enterprise networks using smart-phone devices; SGX-based cloud security module with user's sole control; communication solutions for power measurement in the cloud; an experimental study of the transmit power for a USRP software-defined radio; multilook SAR image enhancement using the dual tree complex wavelet transform; supervized change detection for SAR imagery based on processing of a low size training data set by an ensemble of self-organizing maps; human and artificial intelligence driven incentive-operation model and algorithms for a multi-purpose integrated crowdsensing-crowdsourcing scalable system; adaptive IED spectrum sensing algorithm for different duty cycle values; and complex domain adaptive system identification using sparse affine projection normalized correlation algorithms under impulsive noises. © 2018 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
