AB  - Nowadays SCADA systems are used for various applications like Home automation, Greenhouse automation, agriculture, power plants etc. SCADA stands for 'Supervisory Control And Data Acquisition' System. These SCADA applications include climate and light Control, Security and Surveillance, Level Monitoring, control and manage separated utility sites and Control of Shutters and Doors and so on. With the arrival of new technologies here a system is proposed which can perform the similar SCADA applications at lower cost and lower maintenances. This system proposes a reasonable solution for SCADA like applications which include critical infrastructure monitoring for electricity distribution plant. SCADA system perform these industrial applications & proposes a web based solution to access all these collected data and equipments. In this system internet based remote application is used by using which we can access industrial equipments, data of organisation via internet. It also provides strong encryption. This system provides various features like alarm generation, access control, automated system, logging and generation of reports etc. As the system provides standard alarm and SMS system, It can be used for remote monitoring. It improves the visibility of the system for operator. It increases the efficiency & reliability of the monitoring system. It can also used for monitoring Medium voltage and low voltage applications. © 2018 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
