AB  - The proceedings contain 13 papers. The topics discussed include: an automated model-based test oracle for access control systems; testing service oriented architectures using stateful service virtualization via machine learning; planning-based security testing of web applications; sentinel: generating GUI tests for android sensor leaks; on the effectiveness of random testing for android: or how i learned to stop worrying and love the monkey; towards software-defined and self-driving cloud infrastructure; improving continuous integration with similarity-based test case selection; memory corruption detecting method using static variables and dynamic memory usage; guided test case generation through AI enabled output space exploration; and using controlled numbers of real faults and mutants to empirically evaluate coverage-based test case prioritization. © 2018 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
