TI  - A survey on Proof of Retrievability for cloud data integrity and availability: Cloud storage state-of-the-art, issues, solutions and future trends
PY  - 2018
T2  - Journal of Network and Computer Applications
VL  - 110
SP  - 75
EP  - 86
DO  - 10.1016/j.jnca.2018.03.017
