AB  - The proceedings contain 195 papers. The topics discussed include: a Jaccard base similarity measure to improve performance of CF based recommender systems; unified logging system for monitoring multiple cloud storage providers in cloud storage broker; improved UGRNN for short-term traffic flow prediction with multi-feature sequence inputs; user scenario based video contents creation system; multi-finger motion inference using M1 neural decoding; a transformation analysis of 3D virtual object for projection mapping; a comparative study of failover schemes for IaaS recovery; a study on near-real-time geometric correction system of drones image; history-enhanced focused website segment crawler; proposal of a personal agent for human centric information networking; a study for improvement of throughput in high-density wireless networks using transmitting opportunity control; fireplug: flexible and robust N-version geo-replication of graph databases; quality control scheme based on VBR characteristics for improving QoE of UHD streaming service; strategic defense and attack in deception based network security; and a secure WebRTC/WoT-based health-care architecture enhanced with access control. © 2018 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
