AB  - The proceedings contain 14 papers. The topics discussed include: the challenging nexus of technology and security in transportation management center operations; understanding past, current and future communication and situational awareness technologies for first responders; advancing cybersecurity education: pink elephant unicorn; hardening web applications using a least privilege DBMS access model; operational characteristics of modern malware: PCO threats; development of industrial network forensics lessons; qualitative risk assessment of cyberattacks on power systems; developing a taxonomy of cyber attacks in WAMS; security as a service: real-time intrusion detection in Internet of Things; situational awareness for SCADA systems; vulnerabilities under the surface; dealing with espionage in organizations; exploring ensemble classifiers for detecting attacks in the smart grids; and cyber security considerations on PMU-based state estimation. © 2018 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
