AB  - Secure storage of data and access control are important research areas. Especially in recent years, with the introduction of the new computing model of cloud computing, this research area has once again become one of the hot spots of concern and research. Most users do not want their data to be accessed or used by others without authorization when using cloud storage services. One of the main ways to solve this problem is to use cryptography to encrypt and store data. However, the traditional symmetric encryption system only satisfies one-to-one communication and does not conform to the multi-user access model under information sharing. © 2019 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
