TI  - CAVAS: Neutralizing application and container security vulnerabilities in the cloud native era
PY  - 2018
T2  - Lecture Notes of the Institute for Computer Sciences, Social-Informatics and Telecommunications Engineering, LNICST
VL  - 254
SP  - 471
EP  - 490
DO  - 10.1007/978-3-030-01701-9_26
