AB  - Cloud is latest technology which is been used from last two decades and it consists of the large amount of data people storing from all around globe. Most of the organizations and individuals has moved their data to cloud mostly giving emphasis on security. The main problem on which there is need to find solutions faced by everyone is to share the data all over the globe or at organizational level safely without allowing unauthorized access. To overcome the threat to share the data safely and securely over the cloud, an efficient data encryption algorithm for encrypting data before sending it to the cloud. In this review paper, we are looking between Researches in security, Privacy Issues in Mobile-Cloud Computing. This paper gives brief idea about encryption algorithms advantages and limitations. © 2018 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
