AB  - The most challenging task of cloud computing is to offer reliable data protection to cloud users while enabling rich applications. Implementation of such DPaaS cloud platform architecture reduces the per-application development effort dramatically and provides data protection while allowing rapid development and maintenance. In this research, we explored a new cloud platform architecture and proposed a paradigm, data protection as a service to enforce data security and privacy and offers evidence of privacy, even in the compromised or malicious applications to data owners. © 2018 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
