AB  - Security is a key problem to restrict the promotion of cloud computing, access control has important effect on security of cloud data for the distributed and dynamic characteristics of cloud computing. In order to realize the fine grained access control in cloud computing environment, the sensitivity classification strategy of objects and the authorization rules between the object owner and the cloud server have been studied. And then the classified-task-role access control model(CT-RBAC) according to T-RBAC model has been designed to get better efficiency and fine grain. © 2017 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
