AB  - Web services encompass a collection of programs that are intended to offer a reliable end-to-end communication between the server and remote user. The common categorization of web services includes authentication, authorization, and security. Different approaches have been proposed to enhance the services through numerous methods. This paper provides yet another approach for improving the overall performance of all three phases of web services by proposing three novel approaches in each stage. The results are well compared with its base work and have proven the proposed model is suitable for the present web services environment. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
